{
  "slug": "deepread",
  "name": "Deepread",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI-native document processing API for AI agents. Extract text and structured data from PDFs and images with 97%+ accuracy using multi-model consensus. Includes OCR extraction, PDF form filling, PII redaction (14 types, HIPAA/GDPR ready), and Bring Your Own Key (BYOK) for zero LLM costs. Free 2,000 pages/month.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **9 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (9): `api` (Full DeepRead API reference), `byok` (Bring Your Own Key to DeepRead), `form-fill` (AI-powered PDF form filling via DeepRead), `insurance` (Extract structured data from insurance claims, policies, EOBs, and loss reports), `invoice` (Extract structured data from invoices, receipts, and bills using DeepRead), `legal` (Extract structured data from contracts, legal agreements, court filings, and compliance documents), `medical` (Extract structured data from medical records, lab reports, prescriptions, and clinical documents), `pii` (Redact PII from documents before sharing or sending to LLMs), and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install deepread@claude-community` from `deepread-tech/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
